    "name": "Sub-Basin Delineation for the Upper East River, Colorado, United States",
    "description": [
      "Upper East sub-basins are delineated as area contributing flow to SFA 2016 stream gage locations. Shapefile attributes include sub-basin ID, name, area (m2 and km2) and codes for spatial contributions to EBC and PH used by Carroll et al. (2018). Geospatial reference is UTM 1983 zone 13. JPEG image provided to show sub-basin delineation with respect to surface geology (Gothic Quadrangle: Gaskill et al., 1991; Maroon Bells Quadrangle: Bryant, 1969).",
      "This dataset can be opened using any GIS software (e.g. QGIS, ArcGIS)."
